# Invoice template of a furniture workshop: the "invoice" example of stxt-pdf with Slots for what changes from one
# invoice to another. The workshop (logo, details, payment details, terms) is part of the template; the customer, the
# dates, the lines and the totals come in the data. The lines of the table repeat with [lines], one Row for each line,
# and the amounts arrive already written, as text, because the fill puts values and does not calculate: the QR code
# of the transfer (the EPC format that banking apps read) takes the total without format, in transfer_amount. The
# order and the email of the customer are optional. invoice.json has the sample data.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Page:
		Paper: A4
		Margin: 44 44 60 44
	Title: Invoice ${number}
	Language: en
	Section:
		Page overlay:
			Id: footer
			Offset: auto 0 -34 0
			Box:
				Padding: 6 0 0 0
				Border: 0.5 0 0 0
				Border color: #DCCFB8
			Stack:
				Horizontal: justify
				Item:
					Text: Taller Nogal S.L. · Registered in the Girona Commercial Register, volume 2217, folio 88
				Item:
					Text: Page {page} of {pages}
		Stack:
			Id: masthead
			Horizontal: justify
			Vertical: center
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 30 0
			Item:
				Image: examples/brand/nogal.svg
					Alt: Nogal, furniture workshop
					Box:
						Width: 172
			Item:
				Block:
					Text: Invoice
						Typography:
							Size: 28
							Bold: true
							Color: #3B2A1E
							Align: right
							Line height: 30
							Case: uppercase
							Letter spacing: 2
					Text: No. ${number}
						Typography:
							Size: 12
							Color: #A65C1B
							Align: right
		Grid:
			Id: parties
			Column sizes: * *
			Gap: 18
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 18 0
			Area:
				Block:
					Style: party
					Text: From
						Style: label
					Text: Taller Nogal S.L.
						Style: strong
					Text: Tax ID B-17482930
					Text: Carrer de la Farga, 14 · Polígono Les Torres
					Text: 17800 Olot (Girona)
					Text: administracion@tallernogal.example
						Link: mailto:administracion@tallernogal.example
			Area:
				Block: {customer}
					Style: party
					Text: Bill to
						Style: label
					Text: <name>
						Style: strong
					Text: Tax ID ${tax_id}
					Text: [address]
					Text: <?email>
						Link: mailto:${email}
		Grid:
			Id: strip
			Column sizes: repeat(4, *)
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 22 0
				Padding: 9 14
				Border: 0.5 0 0.5 0
				Border color: #A65C1B
			Area:
				Block:
					Text: Issue date
						Style: label
					Text: <issued>
			Area:
				Block:
					Text: Due date
						Style: label
					Text: <due>
			Area:
				Block:
					Text: Payment method
						Style: label
					Text: <payment_method>
			Area:
				Block:
					Text: Order
						Style: label
					Text: <?order>
		Table:
			Id: lines
			Column sizes: 54 * 38 64 94
			Column align: left left right right right
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 24 0
			Header rows:
				Row:
					Cell: Ref.
					Cell: Description
					Cell: Qty
					Cell: Price
					Cell: Amount
			Body:
				Row: [lines]
					Cell: <ref>
					Cell: <description>
						Row header: true
					Cell: <quantity>
					Cell: <price>
					Cell: <amount>
			Footer rows:
				Row:
					Cell: Taxable base
						Row header: true
						Span: 1 4
					Cell: <base>
				Row:
					Cell: VAT (${vat_rate})
						Row header: true
						Span: 1 4
					Cell: <vat>
				Row:
					Style: total
					Cell: Total due
						Row header: true
						Span: 1 4
					Cell: <total>
		Grid:
			Id: payment
			Column sizes: * *
			Gap: 18
			Area:
				Stack:
					Gap: 12
					Item:
						Grow: 1
						Block:
							Typography:
								Markup: markdown
								Code font: IBM Plex Mono
							Text: Payment details
								Style: label
							Paragraph: **`ES91 2100 0418 4502 0005 1332`**
							Paragraph: Caixa Girona · BIC `CAIXESBBXXX`
							Paragraph: Include the **invoice number** in the payment reference.
					Item:
						Barcode:
							Id: payment-qr
							Alt: QR code to pay the invoice by transfer: ${total} to Taller Nogal S.L.
							Box:
								Width: 76
							Content >>
								BCD
								002
								1
								SCT
								CAIXESBBXXX
								Taller Nogal S.L.
								ES9121000418450200051332
								EUR${transfer_amount}


								Invoice ${number}
			Area:
				Block:
					Text: Terms
						Style: label
					Paragraph: The furniture remains the property of the workshop until the invoice is paid in full. **Five-year** warranty on frame and hardware; solid wood may vary slightly in tone, as befits a living material.
						Typography:
							Size: 8
							Color: #5C4E43
							Markup: markdown
